Awesome demo!<br><br>After seeing the ACD link, it reminded me of this paper.<br><br><a href="http://www.ee.technion.ac.il/~ayellet/Ps/0325_ayt.pdf" class="postlink">http://www.ee.technion.ac.il/~ayellet/Ps/0325_ayt.pdf</a><br><br>It also seems to do a good job of breaking down meshes into "near" convex pieces. <br><br>I wonder if either of these approximate techniques combined with a simple convex hull computation would have any merit.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=476">koz</a> — Fri May 26, 2006 6:13 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
